SLACKWARE-CURRENT PERSONAL PACKAGES

Personal SlackBuilds and local package customizations for Slackware-current.
This branch contains packages used on my machine that differ from the
SlackBuilds.org versions or are not suitable for upstream submission.

WHY

Packages are kept here either for custom config.h files, local patches, or
because the SlackBuilds.org version uses an older release or different
patches than what I run. Full SlackBuilds are kept so each package remains
rebuildable.

PACKAGES

desktop/dwm
desktop/dmenu
desktop/herbe
desktop/slstatus
misc/bdf2psf
misc/xhidecursor
